    "body": "Lexer confirms that the earlier version did rotate left/right, although it sometimes also zoomed, and now the stick does nothing. The current implementation explicitly disables Modern Controls and rejects its patch; this loss of input was introduced by that disable, not established as a controller problem. Preserve the observed partial success as repair evidence. Restore proportional left/right camera rotation while removing unintended zoom/movement, and make unavailable state clear in the editor. Work remains deferred at the user's budget boundary; no new test or implementation started.",
